<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36198" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντέλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>enjoin, command,</i>
			
				Act.
			 only in <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				7.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				269
			</span></i>:— mostly in 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.47
				</span></i>
			, etc.; in a will, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλοις ταῦτα ἐντέλλομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diog.Oen.
					66
				</span></i>
			: c. dat. pers. et inf., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				393e
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντείλασθαι ἀπὸ γλώσσης</span>
			<i>command</i> by word of mouth, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.123
			</span></i>: so in pf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντέταλται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>3 Ki.</u>
					13.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντεταλμένοι εἴησαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					18.2.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				1.9.9
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐντεταλμένα</span>”
				<i>commands,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.60
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				5.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				462
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.5.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>invest with legal powers, authorize to act,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. σοι καὶ ἐπιτρέπω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLips.</u>
					38.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMasp.</u>
				124.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>.</div>
